There appears before you a threatening figure clad all over in
heavy black armor. His legs seem like the massive trunk of the
oak tree. His broad shoulders and helmeted head loom high over
your own puny frame, and you realize that his powerful arms could 
easily crush the very life from you body. There hangs from his belt 
a veritable arsenal of deadly weapons: sword, mace, ball and chain, 
dagger, lance, and trident. He speaks with a commanding voice:

                  355847 'Identify yourself.'


 
Suddenly a sinister, wrathlike figure appears before you seeming
to float in the air. In a low, sorrowful voice he says, Alas, the 
very nature of the world has changed and the dungeon cannot be found. 
All must now pass away. Raising his oaken staff in farewell, he fades 
spreading darkness. In his place appears a tastefully lettered sign 
reading:
                       PASSWORD INVALID 
  
The darkness becomes all encompassed, and your vision fails.
 
You better learn some magic before you try that again!

